  "id": "mate-value",
  "term": "mate value",
  "definition": "Mate value is a person’s perceived desirability as a romantic partner. In this research context, it refers to how desirable someone is compared with their partner or other possible partners, and differences in partners’ mate value are linked to relationship satisfaction.",
